{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>**A student team project designed to deliver a ~10 minute experience.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not Raised by Wolves</strong> is a third-person shooter where you play as La Coyota, an anthropomorphic gunslinger fighting through an ancient AI facility to rescue her colony\u2019s pups. Armed with a trusty revolver and aided by your robotic sidekick, you\u2019ll dash, aim, and shoot your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008720/extras/d73aa509334a740f23373904c5f4a0da.poster.avif?t=1757446121\" width=900 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008720/extras/d73aa509334a740f23373904c5f4a0da.webm?t=1757446121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008720/extras/d73aa509334a740f23373904c5f4a0da.mp4?t=1757446121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your revolver\u2019s dual firing modes to adapt to every encounter, and unleash your drone\u2019s hacking ability to temporarily stun enemies, expose their weak points, and set up the perfect kill shot. Every fight demands quick reflexes, clever use of your tools, and the grit to keep moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008720/extras/2a1069eb228280b38a76f19342fd666d.poster.avif?t=1757446121\" width=900 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008720/extras/2a1069eb228280b38a76f19342fd666d.webm?t=1757446121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008720/extras/2a1069eb228280b38a76f19342fd666d.mp4?t=1757446121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008720?t=1757446121","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008720/15dbf47380de41154571ea927014133cfe4878ab/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757446121","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008720/f05d3b0e62af38cbc678cb1e185aa9fdf5de3780/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757446121","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008720/f05d3b0e62af38cbc678cb1e185aa9fdf5de3780/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757446121","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>**A student team project designed to deliver a ~10 minute experience.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not Raised by Wolves</strong> is a third-person shooter where you play as La Coyota, an anthropomorphic gunslinger fighting through an ancient AI facility to rescue her colony\u2019s pups. Armed with a trusty revolver and aided by your robotic sidekick, you\u2019ll dash, aim, and shoot your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008720/extras/d73aa509334a740f23373904c5f4a0da.poster.avif?t=1757446121\" width=900 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008720/extras/d73aa509334a740f23373904c5f4a0da.webm?t=1757446121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008720/extras/d73aa509334a740f23373904c5f4a0da.mp4?t=1757446121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your revolver\u2019s dual firing modes to adapt to every encounter, and unleash your drone\u2019s hacking ability to temporarily stun enemies, expose their weak points, and set up the perfect kill shot. Every fight demands quick reflexes, clever use of your tools, and the grit to keep moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008720/extras/2a1069eb228280b38a76f19342fd666d.poster.avif?t=1757446121\" width=900 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008720/extras/2a1069eb228280b38a76f19342fd666d.webm?t=1757446121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008720/extras/2a1069eb228280b38a76f19342fd666d.mp4?t=1757446121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Vancouver Film School"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008720/a0bf90990bd7f8a30ad0e09e8846568fb14dea1a/header.jpg?t=1757446121","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257192710,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192710/movie480.mp4?t=1757446118","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192710/movie_max.mp4?t=1757446118"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257192710/f2e1fd46379c5fdda871d39aede6fe1c5de4bda2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757446118","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192710/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757446118","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com